<title>USA: Genzyme Corp Q3 net off after charges.</title>
<headline>Genzyme Corp Q3 net off after charges.</headline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			 Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			 September 30,		 September 30,</p>
<p>			 1996	1995	 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Revenues:     141,022    94,484  366,793	274,001</p>
<p>Net income (loss) attributable</p>
<p>to General Division Stock</p>
<p>		     $(5,908)  $16,092   $33,410	$41,057</p>
<p>Per General Division Common Share:</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common and</p>
<p>common equivalent share </p>
<p>		     $(0.09)    $0.27	$0.46	  $0.71</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding</p>
<p>		     69,440    60,558     73,024	 57,632</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common share</p>
<p>assuming full dilution</p>
<p>		    $(0.09)    $0.24	 $0.45	 $0.65</p>
<p>Average fully diluted</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		    69,440    65,792	74,146	63,342</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 and nine-month 96 net and per share include one-time charges, net of related income taxes, of $27.5 million, or $0.38 per share, from the acquisition of DSP.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
